\documentclass{article}
\title{A Pipeline for Weekly Influenza Surveillance}
\author{G. Andersson and F. Diallo}
\date{April 2026}
\begin{document}
\maketitle
\section{Data Flow}
Every Friday the ingestion job pulls case extracts from the regional servers.
It first validates file_name$ against the published manifest
and then updates user_id$ so that dashboards always read the newest snapshot.
Records that fail validation are quarantined for manual review,
and the quarantine queue is summarised in the weekly bulletin.
\end{document}

